   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Incandescent Ruins** (1 other source): Uploader says this was a new song, played live for the first time at this show; The song was first left out of the download because John wanted unreleased new songs kept private [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Saigon Shrunken Panorama**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Picture of My Dress**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Absolute Lithops Effect**: back after 109 archived shows (2300 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **The Destruction of the Kola Superdeep Borehole Tower**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Ontario**: back after 162 archived shows (3823 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Solidarity Forever**: rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Incandescent Ruins [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mountaingoats2021-09-16.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 22 songs; 85 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mountaingoats2021-09-16.flac16**: taped by ezralite23; transferred by ezralite23; source: SP-TFB-2-13098P mics > Battery box > Zoom H4N [1]",
